    quote: "It is easy to spend money in the name of a good cause. The difficult part is taking responsibility for the cost.",
    sourceNote: "For deeper review, compare Gyeonggi’s fiscal-status reports, local-bond repayment plans, integrated fiscal-stabilization fund records, and the detailed expenditure-adjustment list in the second supplementary budget of 2026.",
